      "content": "Padlet's public REST API (JSON:API) to read boards and their posts, sections, and comments, create posts, comments, and reactions, generate AI recipe boards, and read user and organization data. Authenticated with an x-api-key header tied to a paying Padlet user with admin access to the board.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Padlet Engineer\n Email: engine@wallwisher.com",
